. It's foppish with a poisonous tongue and always teases Ganmo for being so odd-looking.\n\nAnd so begin the messed up daily lives of young Hanpeita and his new pet.\n\n(Source: Wikipedia)"},"tags":[{"name":"Animals","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Gu-Gu Ganmo","english":null,"native":"Gu-Guガンモ","romaji":"Gu-Gu Ganmo","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"小金毛"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}